if item_list.length > 0
  - var count = 0
  h2 List of testable ICT accessibility requirements
  p Below is the list of requirements selected in the "ICT accessibility requirements with informative sections" document which can be evaluated for conformance. This can be used as a starting point when creating an Accessibility Conformance Report (ACR), or to better understand what can be evaluated.
  ul
    each item in test_list 
      li #{item.number} #{item.name}
      - count = count + 1
  p Total count of testable requirements: <strong>#{count}</strong>